Configure         -  configuration script
Makefile          -  Makefile for LIPS-Tools ( based on default configuration )
Makefile.filter   -  sed script for generating 'Makefile'
Makefile.in       -  source of 'Makefile'
Readme-E          -  this file
Readme-J          -  Japanese version of file list
Readme.1st        -  'read me' file
cmd-lib           -  directory includes commands for LIPS-Tools
doc               -  directory includes document files
jsax-if           -  directory includes Tcl/Tk libraries for JUMAN & SAX
law-model         -  top directory of controlled linguistic model 
                                                            for law sentences
lips.in           -  source file of 'lips' command
lipsrc.sample.in  -  source file of sample file of '.lipsrc'
tcl-lib           -  Tcl/Tk libraries for LIPS-Tools

